# The bench session against sitting 4c's faults, in the simulator: the
# normal re-verify run (as ipodui-p19-bench-reverify) with two fault
# switches set while the visualiser step is outside the session:
#  - bench_sim set putfail 1: the next results-file open fails, once (the
#    device's lost lines): it is uviz's result line, written at Go on;
#  - bench_sim set lowmem: the probe image's block is refused while music
#    plays (the visualiser's album still playing at jvpu).
# The runner must not lose or run again any step (each step once, in
# order: 4c bugs a and c), and jvpu must still pass (4c bug b), so the
# verified line is still earned.  Then, while uck1 is outside, bench_sim
# set putfails 9: nine opens in a row fail, so three writes are refused at
# three tries each (FAULT bench put): their lines wait in the RAM queue
# and go in first, in order, at the next write that opens; none reaches
# bcmtest.log's "bench unsaved:" fallback (the queue holds 8).
# Generated by scripts/bench_sim_script.py (faults); edit that, not this.
# needs: video
# golden: skip
# log: results file: open refused (fault switch)
# log: results file: open refused in a row (fault switch)
# log: FAULT bench put
# nolog: bench unsaved:
# nolog: bench_sim: watchdog
# timeout: 300
wait 4000
bench_sim reset          # no results files, the model's defaults
wheel +20 40            # the last row (Now Playing while music plays)
wait 400
wheel -1 200            # Settings
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
key SELECT              # About
wait 1500
chord SELECT+LEFT 3200  # Developer
wait 1000
wheel +1 200            # Bench session
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 1200
wheel +40 10          # Re-verify the video image
wait 400
wheel -1 200
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # the confirm screen: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
# -- boot (Display program): the restart
wheel +40 10          # Display program: start
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
wheel +40 10          # Now restart: close
wait 400
key SELECT
wait 800
key LEFT                # the stopped-session screen: leave
wait 800
shot boot_asked
reboot
wait 4000
